description.narrative:
The intervention aims to contribute to the prevention of the COVID-19 spread and staying healthy by following: 
1) Basic human needs of those affected by the new corona virus outbreak have been met through provision of Red Cross services (food distribution, psychological first aid, psychosocial support, stress management, healthy lifestyle, including personal hygiene, etc.), as well as personal protective equipment to volunteer workers and Red Cross staff;
2) Raised awareness of the general public, local communities, mass media, and civil society sector through information campaigns as well as online training carried out by well mobilized and trained Red Cross and community volunteers.
